Kelvin Planck forbids a perfect engine, and Clausius forbids a fridge that needs no power.

4
00:00:12,825 --> 00:00:17,395
An engine's efficiency is one minus Q two over Q one.

5
00:00:17,395 --> 00:00:24,908
The Otto cycle gives one minus one over r to the gamma minus one, and the diesel cycle allows a bigger r.

6
00:00:24,908 --> 00:00:30,898
The Carnot efficiency, one minus T two over T one, is the maximum possible.

7
00:00:30,898 --> 00:00:35,338
A refrigerator's coefficient of performance is Q two over W.

8
00:00:35,338 --> 00:00:41,328
